{"3780520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mercy Incore", "steam_appid": 3780520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/7be42d9473bc3628caa8ae4bbd147794.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Overworld is a realm of medieval floating islands, covered in a mysterious storm. It draws a squad of medieval knights into the Techno bottom-mirrored world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, the protagonist, Murcielago, will witness both worlds: the surreal, bizarre architecture of the Techno Dimension and the ghostly echoes of the world he leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/3e5da96302ef40575a7f91ad3fa1ea56.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Replace your frail, primitive armor with crude, jury-rigged gear cobbled together from techno-scrap just to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, your new armor is held together by rust and desperation—but do you really have time to worry about fashion when stronger enemies ambush you from every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So here’s your choice:  <br>Become a techno-beast… or remain easy prey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/152649c01d272841b8b8dd8614daff0b.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>morph</strong> traditional knight's <strong>Claymore</strong> into a <strong>Scythe</strong> or a <strong>Dagge</strong>r on the run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It’s not about cosmetics—each weapon is a full combat class, with unique strengths and weaknesses against different foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can scratch anyone with a single weapon. But why settle for survival when a single button press gives you the perfect tools for annihilation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/8ab145210ecf1a5dcdb23c5fe6405121.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fighting in the Underworld isn’t a chivalrous duel for a milady’s kiss. There’s no time for health potions or polite bowing. Every attack fuels your Drains —turbine driven hits that steal health from your enemies. There are no potions, no step-by-step circling around enemies —only flow and pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e11c244def54bfa389a0c6369918131d.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Even boring actions like blocking, dodging, and acceleration deal damage. Use it to control crowds, crash the environment, or bulldoze through enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush. Onslaught. Don’t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/943ea5b799f924e2529e77e052897146.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/de982e5888f22e544071dc32c79daa61.webp?t=1785399058\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/de982e5888f22e544071dc32c79daa61.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=438 /></picture></span>Bosses in the techno-dimension aren't epic villains — they're complex, contradictory characters who interact with each other and won't simply fade away after battle. In a realm both alien and hostile, it may be wiser to turn foes into allies… than to annihilate all life and be left alone with the Draincore's hunger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/f0b35171c6dbc5f9a6cede2e2a8dc797.avif?t=1785399058\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by single man with huge passion and countless sleepless nights full of insights. Each element from character to stone was made by hand with love <br><br>All game music kindly created by RoarBack studio </p>", "about_the_game": "<p clas